WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.260
Well tell me how this got over into the television field.

2
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:11.900
First, the station, as I understand, came [?] because the money ran out.

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.700
That’s right.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.220
That’s right.

5
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.040
After ten years.

6
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:25.980
It was established in 1947, and in 1957, the funds for the university were cut drastically.

7
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:39.740
To keep the academic departments of the university afloat, the extras of the side things had to be cut off.

8
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:45.820
The radio station was one of those victims at that time in 1957.

9
00:00:45.820 --> 00:01:08.220
LSU didn’t just drop out of the whole interest because we then cooperated with commercial stations, radio and television stations, to produce programs for commercial stations.
